    "description": "Download Lotus Chess Here! https://onelink.to/lotus-agadmator https://tournament.lotus-chess.com/tournaments\nSearch all my videos easy https://agadmator-library.github.io/\n\nCaruana, Fabiano (2792) - Aronian, Levon (2721)\nGrand Chess Tour: Sinquefield Cup 2026 (Chess.com) [05] 2026.08.14\nC42 Petrov, classical attack, Marshall variation\n\n1.e4 e5 2.Nf3 Nf6 3.Nxe5 d6 4.Nf3 Nxe4 5.d4 d5 6.Bd3 Bd6 7.O-O O-O 8.c4 c6 9.Re1 Re8 10.Qb3 Nd7 11.cxd5 cxd5 12.Nc3 Nxc3 13.Bg5 Be7 14.bxc3 Bxg5 15.Nxg5 Nf6 16.c4 Rxe1+ 17.Rxe1 h6 18.Nf3 b6 19.c5 Bg4 20.Ne5 bxc5 21.Qb7 Qe8 22.dxc5 Rb8 23.Qa6 Qe7 24.h3 Bh5 25.Qd6 Qxd6 26.cxd6 Rd8 27.d7 Bg6 28.Bb5 a6 29.Ba4 Bf5 30.Nc6 Bxd7 31.Nxd8 Bxa4 32.f3 Nh5 33.Nb7 Nf4 34.Nc5 Bb5 35.a4 Bc4 36.h4 g5 37.hxg5 hxg5 38.Re5 Kg7 39.Rxg5+ Kf6 40.Rg4 Ke5 41.Kf2 d4 42.g3 Nh3+ 43.Kg2 Kd5 44.Nd7 f5 45.Rg7 Kd6 46.Nb6\n\n0:01 Hello Everyone!\n\nCheck out agadmator's merch here https://teespring.com/stores/agadmators-swag-store\nhttps://teespring.com/design-with-a-story-tm\n\nMailbox where you can send stuff:\n\nAntonio Radić\nAGADMATOR d.o.o.\nFranje Tuđmana 12\nCroatia\n48260 Križevci \np.s. this is not my home address :)\n\nContact me: agadmator@gmail.com \n\nVideo created by OBS\n\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nIf you realllly enjoy my content, you're welcome to support me and my channel with a small donation via PayPal or Crypto.\n\nLink to PayPal donation https://www.paypal.me/agadmator\n\nBTC address bc1qckd3ut0hqyymzv33eus97ld8klj02xhk2kcwld\n\nFor any other currency address, contact me via agadmator@gmail.com\n\nCheck out some of the books I enjoy https://www.amazon.com/ideas/amzn1.account.AFWWCIBWCL5PGEPL73FDWK632F7Q/2QAGBMLVXE7MG\n\nCheck out ALL my videos here https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fYgd5ZLdHz8&list=PLDnx7w_xuguFTxcfiM11bB1JchtHclEJg\n\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/agadmatoryoutube\nTwitter: https://twitt